# 真库演练库 costb31_drill 的状态取证（2026-11-11）

## 1) 成本批次表结构（判据依赖的列）
                                            Table "public.biz_cost_period"
        Column        |           Type           | Collation | Nullable |                   Default                    
----------------------+--------------------------+-----------+----------+----------------------------------------------
 id                   | uuid                     |           | not null | gen_random_uuid()
 org_id               | uuid                     |           | not null | '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000'::uuid
 period_code          | character varying(7)     |           | not null | 
 batch_no             | character varying(32)    |           | not null | 
 status               | character varying(12)    |           | not null | 'DRAFT'::character varying
 labor_source         | character varying(12)    |           | not null | 'MANUAL'::character varying
 object_count         | integer                  |           | not null | 0
 total_material       | numeric(18,4)            |           | not null | 0
 total_labor          | numeric(18,4)            |           | not null | 0
 total_overhead       | numeric(18,4)            |           | not null | 0
 total_cost           | numeric(18,4)            |           | not null | 0
 total_finished       | numeric(18,4)            |           | not null | 0
 total_wip            | numeric(18,4)            |           | not null | 0
 approval_instance_id | uuid                     |           |          | 
 labor_voucher_id     | uuid                     |           |          | 
 overhead_voucher_id  | uuid                     |           |          | 
 finish_voucher_id    | uuid                     |           |          | 
 settled_at           | timestamp with time zone |           |          | 
 settled_by           | uuid                     |           |          | 
 reversed_at          | timestamp with time zone |           |          | 
 reversed_by          | uuid                     |           |          | 
 reverse_reason       | character varying(255)   |           |          | 
 cancel_reason        | character varying(255)   |           |          | 
 remark               | text                     |           |          | 
 created_at           | timestamp with time zone |           | not null | CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
 updated_at           | timestamp with time zone |           | not null | CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
 create_by            | uuid                     |           |          | 
 update_by            | uuid                     |           |          | 
 deleted_at           | timestamp with time zone |           |          | 
Indexes:
    "biz_cost_period_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (id)
    "idx_biz_cost_period_status" btree (status, period_code DESC)
    "uk_biz_cost_period" UNIQUE, btree (org_id, period_code) WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND (status::text <> ALL (ARRAY['REVERSED'::character varying, 'CANCELLED'::character varying]::text[]))
    "uk_biz_cost_period_no" UNIQUE, btree (batch_no) WHERE deleted_at IS NULL
Check constraints:
    "ck_biz_cost_period_appr" CHECK ((status::text <> ALL (ARRAY['SUBMITTED'::character varying, 'APPROVED'::character varying, 'SETTLED'::character varying, 'CLOSED'::character varying, 'REVERSED'::character varying]::text[])) OR approval_instance_id IS NOT NULL)
    "ck_biz_cost_period_cancel" CHECK (status::text <> 'CANCELLED'::text OR cancel_reason IS NOT NULL)

